<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Chancellor said upped to buy.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Chancellor said upped to buy.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Prudential Securities raised its rating on Chancellor Broadcasting Co on Thursday to a buy rating from a hold rating, according to a source at Prudential.</p>
<p>-- Chancellor shares closed at 36-7/8 on Wednesday.</p>
</text>
